-- AllTrails claims, generated by script/import_alltrails/build.py
-- from data/alltrails/pilot.jsonl. Do not hand-edit: re-generate.
--
-- One claim group per (feature, trail). The counts describe a walk and a
-- walk is not a waterfall, so they are never summed onto the feature --
-- see migration 057 and docs/MATCHING.md.
--
-- Groups that failed the name test are recorded with identity_certain =
-- false and the reason in the note. They are kept rather than dropped so
-- the next importer can see the match was considered and refused.

